Manifest-Version: 1.0
Plugin-Class: org.openstreetmap.josm.plugins.betterworkspace.BetterWorkspacePlugin
Plugin-Description: Adds a BetterWorkspace submenu under More Tools: open a secondary view-only map window synced to the main one, load HOT Tasking Manager task grids, toggle the active layer's visibility, todo list plugin keep completed items visible, additional validator checks, preview quick TMS imagery layers, load Esri World Imagery's acquisition-date grids, and reorder the docked side panels.
Plugin-Icon: images/betterworkspace/betterworkspace.svg
Plugin-Link: https://github.com/Patrik-Br/BetterWorkspace-JOSM-plugin
Plugin-Mainversion: 19555
Plugin-Canloadatruntime: true
Author: Patrik_B
Plugin-Version: 1.1.1
